            <description><![CDATA[<h2>后台运行改进</h2>
<ul>
  <li>Spotlight 无窗口运行时显示菜单栏状态，任务结束后空闲 15 秒自动退出。</li>
  <li>CLI 取消或退出时及时结束所属处理进程。</li>
  <li>纯 Spotlight 后台唤起不启动更新检查和索引同步。</li>
  <li>通用设置新增后台活动说明和任务计数。</li>
</ul>
<p>隐藏或最小化的工作窗口会保留。重启安装前，请导出需要保留的输入和结果。</p>
<h2>Background activity improvements</h2>
<ul>
  <li>Show Spotlight activity in the menu bar and quit after 15 idle seconds with no open windows.</li>
  <li>Stop workers promptly when the CLI is cancelled or exits.</li>
  <li>Skip update checks and indexing on Spotlight-only background launches.</li>
  <li>Add background activity information and task counts to General settings.</li>
</ul>
<p>Hidden and minimized workspaces remain open. Export current inputs and results before restarting.</p>
]]></description>
